<p>Surround yourself with a defensive aura, increasing armor by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 6, 9, 12, 15,</acronym> and inflicting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> fire and <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> blight damage to all attacking foes.</p><p>Additionally, your vim will enhance your defences, reducing all damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 9%, 15%, 20%, 25%</acronym> of your current vim (currently 0), but never reducing by more than half of the original damage. This will cost vim equal to 5% of the damage blocked.</p><p>The damage will scale with your Spellpower.</p>